","updated_at":"2026-10-27T08:15:19Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/dotkoval/xpeccy-plus/releases/download/v2026.8.2/xpeccy-plus-2026.8.2-win-x86.zip"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotkoval/xpeccy-plus/tarball/v2026.8.2","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotkoval/xpeccy-plus/zipball/v2026.8.2","body":"**Xpeccy+ 2026.8.2**\r\n\r\nA fork of [Xpeccy](https://github.com/samstyle/Xpeccy) by SAM style. All the emulation code comes from that project. On top of [2026.8.1](https://github.com/dotkoval/xpeccy-plus/releases/tag/v2026.8.1), fixes for older computers and for the debugger:\r\n\r\n- **Starts without OpenGL**: on graphics with no usable OpenGL, such as 2010 Intel HD\r\n  laptops, the program now shows the picture without shaders instead of closing.\r\n  `--no-gl` does the same on purpose. *(thanks to Lis for the report)*\r\n- **Downloads need no curl**: the Next's card and FFmpeg download on Windows 8.1 too, and a\r\n  cancelled FFmpeg download continues where it stopped. *(thanks to DruzhininPavel for the\r\n  report)*\r\n- **The System/Next Card window reads the path**: a card with System/Next on it is used,\r\n  a new folder or `.img` becomes a new card. *(thanks to Volutar)*\r\n- **The debugger and divMMC and the Next**: breakpoints in divMMC's memory fire, the\r\n  listing, dump and MEMMAP show it paged in, the dump has a DIV view, and the Next counts\r\n  in its own 8K pages. SjASMPlus labels land on their pages, `CSPECTMAP` files load too.\r\n  *(thanks to janko-jj, AlexZor and Serdjuk)*\r\n- **Fullscreen on a second monitor** fits that monitor. *(thanks to Sergio Neznany for the\r\n  report)*\r\n- **The user manual** follows the program's menus now: a page per menu, per Options page\r\n  and per debugger panel, in English, Russian, Ukrainian and Spanish.\r\n\r\nFull list of changes in [CHANGELOG.md](https://github.com/dotkoval/xpeccy-plus/blob/v2026.8.2/CHANGELOG.md).\r\n"}